# ApexPlanet Internship – Task 2

## Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA) & Business Intelligence

### 📌 Project Overview

This project is part of the **60-Day Data Analytics Internship Program at ApexPlanet Software Pvt. Ltd.**

The objective of Task 2 is to explore a sales and customer transaction dataset, identify meaningful patterns and trends, answer business questions using SQL, perform multivariate analysis, and develop an initial dashboard concept based on the insights obtained from the data.

---

## 🎯 Objectives

The main objectives of this project are:

* Perform exploratory data analysis on the cleaned dataset.
* Calculate descriptive statistics for numerical and categorical variables.
* Analyze individual variables using appropriate visualizations.
* Develop and answer business-oriented questions using SQL.
* Identify relationships and correlations between variables.
* Perform multivariate analysis to discover meaningful patterns.
* Identify key business insights from the dataset.
* Design a static dashboard mock-up highlighting important KPIs and metrics.

